 5232, de 28\/10\/2020\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003C\/td\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003C\/tr\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003C\/table\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003Cdiv style=\u0027float:right;border:1px solid #000000;padding:10px;width:124px;font-size:09px;margin-top:-72px;margin-left: 10px\u0027\u003E\n        \t\t\t\tTCDF\/Secretaria das Sess\u00f5es\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n        \t\t\t\tFolha:............................\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n        \t\t\t\tProcesso: \u003Ca class=\u0027getInfo\u0027 style=\u0027color:green !important;\u0027 href=\u0027?a=processo\u0026f=detalhes\u0026idprocesso=168692\u0026aba=AbaInformacao\u0027 data-toggle=\u0027modal\u0027 data-target=\u0027#mainModal\u0027\u003E00600-00004518\/2020-04\u003Cstrong\u003E-e\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003C\/a\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n        \t\t\t\tRubrica:........................\n        \t\t\t\u003C\/div\u003E\n        \t\t\t\u003C\/div\u003E\u003Cp align=\u0027justify\u0027\u003EPROCESSO N\u00ba \u003Ca class=\u0027getInfo\u0027 style=\u0027color:green !important;\u0027 href=\u0027?a=processo\u0026f=detalhes\u0026idprocesso=168692\u0026aba=AbaInformacao\u0027 data-toggle=\u0027modal\u0027 data-target=\u0027#mainModal\u0027\u003E00600-00004518\/2020-04\u003Cstrong\u003E-e\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp align=\u0027justify\u0027\u003ERELATOR : CONSELHEIRO M\u00c1RCIO MICHEL ALVES DE OLIVEIRA\u003Cdiv align=\u0027justify\u0027\u003EEMENTA : Representa\u0026ccedil;\u0026atilde;o n\u0026ordm; 50\/2020-G2P, da Procuradora Cl\u0026aacute;udia Fernanda de Oliveira Pereira, do Minist\u0026eacute;rio P\u0026uacute;blico junto \u0026agrave; Corte, versando acerca de suposta pr\u0026aacute;tica de nepotismo na Secretaria de Estado de Sa\u0026uacute;de do Distrito Federal - SES\/DF e no Instituto de Gest\u0026atilde;o Estrat\u0026eacute;gica do Distrito Federal \u0026ndash; IGES\/DF, consistente na ocupa\u0026ccedil;\u0026atilde;o do emprego de Assessor Jur\u0026iacute;dico do Instituto, com poss\u0026iacute;vel ofensa aos princ\u0026iacute;pios da moralidade e da impessoalidade, em face do v\u0026iacute;nculo familiar com a Assessora Especial do Gabinete da SES\/DF.\u003C\/div\u003E\u003Cp align=\u0027center\u0027\u003E\u003Cb\u003EDECIS\u00c3O N\u00ba 4760\/2020\u003C\/b\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp align=\u0027justify\u0027\u003EO Tribunal, por unanimidade, de acordo com o voto do Relator, decidiu: I \u0026ndash; tomar conhecimento dos esclarecimentos prestados pela SES\/DF e pelo IGES\/DF (e-docs FD83D64C-c e 4DE92F12-c); II \u0026ndash; considerar prejudicada, por perda de objeto, a Representa\u0026ccedil;\u0026atilde;o n\u0026ordm; 50\/2020 - G2P, seguindo o posicionamento deste Tribunal esposado nas Decis\u0026otilde;es n\u0026ordm;s 4.346\/20, 1.592\/2020, 86\/2018, 91\/2017, 119\/2016 e 985\/2014; III \u0026ndash; autorizar o arquivamento do feito.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp align=\u0027justify\u0027\u003EPresidiu a sess\u0026atilde;o a Presidente, Conselheira ANILC\u0026Eacute;IA MACHADO. Votaram os Conselheiros MANOEL DE ANDRADE, RENATO RAINHA, IN\u0026Aacute;CIO MAGALH\u0026Atilde;ES FILHO, PAIVA MARTINS e M\u0026Aacute;RCIO MICHEL. Participou o representante do MPjTCDF, Procurador-Geral MARCOS FELIPE PINHEIRO LIMA.\u0026nbsp;Ausente o Conselheiro PAULO TADEU.\u003C\/b\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/br\u003E\u003C\/br\u003E\u003C\/br\u003E\u003Cp align=\u0027center\u0027\u003ESALA DAS SESS\u00d5ES, 28 de Outubro de 2020\u003C\/br\u003E\u003C\/br\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp align=\u0027center\u0027\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n        \t\t\u003Cdiv style=\u0027margin-top:-10px\u0027\u003E\n                    \u003Ctable cellpadding=\u00270\u0027 style=\u0027font-size:12px;font-weight:bolder;text-align:center;width:100%\u0027\u003E\n                        \u003Ctr\u003E\n                            \u003Ctd style=\u0027text-align:center;\u0027\u003E\n                                \u003Cimg src=\u0027https:\/\/etcdf.tc.df.gov.br\/public\/img\/assina_374.png\u0027 width=\u0027120px\u0